  "description": "Variation of condition 1 (approved plans) and condition 48 (quantum of development) of planning permission 2017/5024, as amended by 2026/0371, for “Demolition of all existing buildings and structures and construction of buildings comprising mixed tenure new and replacement homes (Class C3); commercial (Class B1) floorspace; mixed retail (Class A1/ A2/ A3) floorspace; new/ replacement community (Class D1) floorspace; a new east/ west pedestrian, cycle and service route and on street disabled vehicle parking; creation of new public spaces and courtyards and new and upgraded pedestrian links; landscaping, including new tree planting and all associated infrastructure, including a new energy centre.”&nbsp;The variations would include amendments to the heights and massing of the approved blocks to provide an additional three dwellings within an amended unit size and tenure mix; a reduction in the amount of commercial floorspace; relocation of the community centre; changes to internal arrangement and external appearance to comply with new building safety requirements; altered proposals for the public realm, landscape and play; changes to the internal road layout; and an update to the energy strategy.",
